                </common:classification>
            </classificationInformation>
            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">Data are a rough estimation of the average production efforts over all types of capacitors. Data for auxillaries, energy, emissions and waste are taken from the Environmental report of a global producer as well as from two datasets out of an international LCI database. Infrastructure and transportation efforts are based on own assumptions. Updates were made in 2023, showing that 20% energy reduction is achieved; UUID: 913f85cb-31da-318d-ad0d-0e419e740cec</common:generalComment>
        </dataSetInformation>
        <quantitativeReference type="Reference flow(s)">
            <referenceToReferenceFlow>1</referenceToReferenceFlow>
        </quantitativeReference>
